  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ttAOcq3.png\" alt=\"Packed Up 横幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"431\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Packed Up</strong> 允许你通过制作<strong>全新的神奇背包</strong>来解决你的库存问题！这让你可以随身携带物品，而无需到处摆放那些恼人的箱子！它也是旅行和探索地牢的理想选择！背包还可以与<strong>Baubles</strong>、<strong>Curios</strong> 和 <strong>Trinkets</strong> 配合使用，并且可以通过快捷键打开！</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔符\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>背包：</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oMnBXzF.png\" alt=\"标准背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;标准背包</strong></h4><p>- 可存放<strong>3行</strong>物品。</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/288/310/172/basic_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"标准背包合成配方\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yu6ubv3.png\" alt=\"铁背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;铁背包</strong></h4><p><strong>- 从<strong>标准背包</strong>升级而来</strong></p><p><strong><strong>- 可存放<strong>4行</strong>物品</strong></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/289/iron_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"铁背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Ixnb230.png\" alt=\"铜背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;铜背包</strong></strong></h4><p>- 从<strong>标准背包</strong>升级而来</p><p>- 可存放<strong>4行</strong>物品</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/290/copper_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"铜背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aKX00AL.png\" alt=\"金背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;金背包</strong></h4><p>- 从<strong>铁背包</strong>或<strong>铜背包</strong>升级而来</p><p>- 可存放<strong>5行</strong>物品</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/291/gold_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"金背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/292/gold_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"金背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0k4GUoC.png\" alt=\"银背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;银背包</strong></h4><p>- 从<strong>铁背包</strong>或<strong>铜背包</strong>升级而来</p><p>- 可存放<strong>5行</strong>物品</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/293/silver_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"银背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/294/silver_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"银背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/bSnWiVc.png\" alt=\"钻石背包\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;钻石背包</strong></h4><p>- 从<strong>金背包</strong>或<strong>银背包</strong>升级而来</p><p>- 可存放<strong>7行</strong>物品</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/295/310/172/diamond_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"钻石背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/296/310/172/diamond_backpack_crafting2.png\" alt=\"钻石背包合成配方\" width=\"260\" height=\"136\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Rtk4qvc.png\" alt=\"黑曜石\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;黑曜石背包</strong></h4><p>- 从<strong>钻石背包</strong>升级而来</p><p>- 可存放<strong>8行</strong>物品</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/281/297/310/172/obsidian_backpack_crafting.png\" alt=\"黑曜石背包合成配方\" width=\"310\" height=\"162\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔符\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>背包自定义</h2><h5>背包可以拥有自定义名称和自定义图标。要自定义背包，只需在手持背包时潜行+右键点击即可。</h5><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/96/customization.webp\" alt=\"背包自定义\" width=\"400\" height=\"270\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔符\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>从背包内部打开另一个背包</strong></h3><h5>1. 右键点击打开一个背包</h5><h5>2. 在背包界面中右键点击另一个背包</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔符\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>常见问题</strong></h3><h4><strong>这个模组添加了铜锭和银锭吗？</strong></h4><h5>不，要合成铜背包和银背包，你需要一个添加了铜锭和银锭的模组。</h5><h4><strong>我可以更改每个背包的存储容量吗？</strong></h4><h5>可以，这可以在<strong>配置文件</strong>中修改。</h5><h4><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong></h4><h5>可以，欢迎在我的模组在你的整合包中使用。</h5><h5>&nbsp;</h5><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔符\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Discord</strong></h3><h5>如需了解未来内容、即将推出的模组以及进行讨论，欢迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 服务器！</h5><h5><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></h5><h5>&nbsp;</h5><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OwFkm6a.png\" alt=\"分隔符\" width=\"1903\" height=\"75\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/287/banner.png\" alt=\"所有可用的背包\" width=\"663\" height=\"109\"></p>",
